{"seq":1,"slug":"stability-tuning","title":"稳定性调校：驯服一具发神经的布娃娃","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ragdoll-physics/practice/stability-tuning","wordCount":1493,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"稳定性调校-驯服一具发神经的布娃娃\">稳定性调校：驯服一具发神经的布娃娃</h1><p>新接上物理的布娃娃十有八九会&quot;发神经&quot;——要么静止时四肢微微抽搐（抖动），要么缓慢往地里沉（穿透），要么某一帧毫无征兆地整个炸向天花板（爆炸）。这些不是玄学，每一种故障都有明确的物理成因，也都有对应的旋钮。稳定性调校就是一套&quot;看症状、定成因、拧对旋钮&quot;的诊断流程。本篇把三大故障族逐一拆解，前置知识是 <a href=\"../simulation/rigid-bodies-joints\">刚体与约束关节</a> 里的求解机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>布娃娃的各种&quot;发神经&quot;表现，可以归到三大故障族——抖动、穿透/下沉、爆炸——每一族都有明确的物理成因与对应旋钮。稳定性调校因此不是玄学，而是一套&quot;看症状、定成因、拧旋钮&quot;的诊断流程。本篇逐族拆解成因与对策，最后汇成一张速查表，并点明所有旋钮本质都是拿 CPU 换稳定这一全局取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障族一-抖动\">故障族一：抖动</h2><p>布娃娃静止时关节处细小的高频颤动，是最常见也最恼人的问题。抖动的根源是求解器在一帧内没能让所有约束同时收敛，残余的约束误差在下一帧被&quot;反弹&quot;回来，帧帧振荡。几个主要诱因与对策：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>迭代次数不足</strong>：长链关节需要足够迭代才能把误差从一端传到另一端。提高求解迭代次数是第一手段。</li>\n<li><strong>极端质量比</strong>：大质量刚体拖着小质量刚体时数值条件差（见 <a href=\"../simulation/rigid-bodies-joints\">刚体与约束关节</a>）。把质量比控制在约 1:10 以内，避免给手指级刚体设过小质量。</li>\n<li><strong>接触抖动</strong>：两个自碰撞胶囊在接触-分离间反复横跳。适当增大接触偏移（contact offset）与接触阻尼，或干脆关掉那对不重要的 <a href=\"../simulation/collision-self\">自碰撞</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>马达刚度过高</strong>：主动布娃娃里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 太大与积分器打架。降刚度或提子步。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"故障族二-穿透与下沉\">故障族二：穿透与下沉</h2><p>布娃娃慢慢陷进地板，或高速坠落时直接穿过薄墙，属于碰撞求解跟不上运动速度。核心量是<strong>单帧位移</strong>与<strong>碰撞体厚度</strong>的比较：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\|\\vec{v}\\|\\,\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 接近或超过肢体厚度时，离散碰撞检测会漏判。对策按代价从低到高：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⇒</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\|\\vec{v}\\|\\cdot \\Delta t &lt; d_{limb} \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad \\Delta t_{sub} = \\frac{\\Delta t}{N_{sub}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">imb</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>提高子步数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{sub}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：把一大步切成若干小步，每小步位移变小，最直接有效。</li>\n<li><strong>启用连续碰撞检测（CCD）</strong>：对高速刚体做扫掠检测，杜绝穿透，但很贵，通常只给根刚体或明确会高速的部件开。</li>\n<li><strong>穿透恢复（penetration recovery）</strong> 别设太猛：分离速度上限若太高，把刚体猛推出穿透状态反而会诱发爆炸——这是穿透与爆炸两族的交叉地带。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"故障族三-爆炸\">故障族三：爆炸</h2><p>最戏剧化的故障：布娃娃某一帧突然获得巨大速度飞出屏幕。爆炸本质是求解器在某处产生了非物理的巨大冲量，几个经典触发源：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[布娃娃爆炸] --&gt; B{初始即炸?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[相邻碰撞未关闭&lt;br/&gt;静止重叠被当穿透弹开]&#10;  B --&gt;|否, 运行中炸| D{刚被大冲量击中?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[受击冲量过大&lt;br/&gt;需限幅 clamp]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F{深度穿透后?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[穿透恢复速度上限太高]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[质量比极端/马达失控&lt;br/&gt;NaN 传播]&#10;  C --&gt; I[关闭相邻自碰撞]&#10;  E --&gt; J[对施加冲量设上限]&#10;  G --&gt; K[限制 max depenetration velocity]&#10;  H --&gt; L[修质量比+力矩饱和+NaN 检测]\">flowchart TD\n  A[布娃娃爆炸] --&gt; B{初始即炸?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[相邻碰撞未关闭&lt;br/&gt;静止重叠被当穿透弹开]\n  B --&gt;|否, 运行中炸| D{刚被大冲量击中?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[受击冲量过大&lt;br/&gt;需限幅 clamp]\n  D --&gt;|否| F{深度穿透后?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[穿透恢复速度上限太高]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[质量比极端/马达失控&lt;br/&gt;NaN 传播]\n  C --&gt; I[关闭相邻自碰撞]\n  E --&gt; J[对施加冲量设上限]\n  G --&gt; K[限制 max depenetration velocity]\n  H --&gt; L[修质量比+力矩饱和+NaN 检测]</pre><p>爆炸最阴险的一种是 <strong>NaN 传播</strong>：某处除零或极端条件算出一个 NaN，通过关节链一帧内污染整具布娃娃，表现为瞬间消失或飞到无穷远。生产中值得加一道 NaN 哨兵：每帧抽查根刚体位置，一旦非有限值就重置或禁用该布娃娃，避免拖垮整个物理场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一张调校速查表\">一张调校速查表</h2><p>把三大故障族与旋钮汇总成决策表，这是实战中最常翻的一页：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>首查旋钮</th>\n<th>次查</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静止抖动</td>\n<td>迭代次数↑</td>\n<td>质量比、接触阻尼</td>\n<td>长链尤其吃迭代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关节被拉长</td>\n<td>迭代次数↑</td>\n<td>约束刚度↑</td>\n<td>见约束求解章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>慢慢沉入地面</td>\n<td>子步数↑</td>\n<td>穿透恢复参数</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高速穿墙</td>\n<td>子步数↑/CCD</td>\n<td>降低击飞初速</td>\n<td>CCD 只给关键刚体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初生成即炸</td>\n<td>关相邻自碰撞</td>\n<td>检查静止重叠</td>\n<td>最高频新手坑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>击中即炸飞</td>\n<td>冲量限幅</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>战斗数值别直接当冲量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瞬间消失</td>\n<td>NaN 哨兵</td>\n<td>质量比/力矩饱和</td>\n<td>加防御性重置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"全局取舍-稳定与开销的天平\">全局取舍：稳定与开销的天平</h2><p>几乎所有稳定性旋钮（迭代、子步、CCD）都是用 CPU 换稳定。盲目全部拉满能让单具布娃娃纹丝不动，但几十具同屏时会拖垮帧率。正确姿势是<strong>先在最恶劣场景（高处坠落、被爆炸群击）调到刚好不炸不抖，再逐步下调直到临界，留一点余量</strong>，把省下的预算交给 <a href=\"ragdoll-performance\">性能与 LOD</a> 去做数量扩展。稳定性与性能是同一枚硬币的两面，永远要一起看。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>布娃娃三大故障族——抖动、穿透/下沉、爆炸——各有明确物理成因与对应旋钮，调校是&quot;看症状、定成因、拧旋钮&quot;的诊断流程。</li>\n<li>抖动多因迭代不足、极端质量比、接触横跳或马达过刚；对策是提迭代、修质量比、加接触阻尼、降刚度。</li>\n<li>穿透因单帧位移超过肢体厚度；提子步最有效，CCD 更彻底但昂贵，穿透恢复速度别设太猛以免诱发爆炸。</li>\n<li>爆炸源于非物理巨大冲量：未关相邻碰撞、受击冲量过大、穿透恢复过猛、或 NaN 传播；生产中应加冲量限幅与 NaN 哨兵。</li>\n<li>所有稳定旋钮都是拿 CPU 换稳定，应在最恶劣场景调到临界留余量，把预算让给性能扩展。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>旋钮背后的求解机制：<a href=\"../simulation/rigid-bodies-joints\">刚体与约束关节</a></li>\n<li>自碰撞抖动的取舍：<a href=\"../simulation/collision-self\">碰撞与自碰撞</a></li>\n<li>把省下的预算用于数量扩展：<a href=\"ragdoll-performance\">性能与 LOD</a></li>\n<li>通用堆叠稳定性技术（跨库）：<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-response/stacking-stability\">游戏物理 · 堆叠稳定性</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"稳定性调校：驯服一具发神经的布娃娃","id":"稳定性调校-驯服一具发神经的布娃娃"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"故障族一：抖动","id":"故障族一-抖动"},{"level":2,"text":"故障族二：穿透与下沉","id":"故障族二-穿透与下沉"},{"level":2,"text":"故障族三：爆炸","id":"故障族三-爆炸"},{"level":2,"text":"一张调校速查表","id":"一张调校速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"全局取舍：稳定与开销的天平","id":"全局取舍-稳定与开销的天平"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"起身与恢复：从物理躺回动画站","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ragdoll-physics/blending/get-up-recovery"},"next":{"title":"性能与 LOD：让几十具布娃娃挤进帧预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ragdoll-physics/practice/ragdoll-performance"}}